+
+Freeze bounded evidence and build a read-only EVALUATOR work order.
+
+Usage:
+
+```text
+agentplane evaluator prepare <task-id> [options]
+```
+
+Options:
+
+- `--evaluator <id>`: Evaluator prompt module id to use. (default=recovery-context)
+- `--json`: Emit machine-readable work-order paths. (default=false)
